    <docset:OperationalNarrative dg:structure="section" dg:origin="1 240 1228 2310 1951">
      <dg:chunk dg:structure="header" dg:origin="1 240 1228 1026 1271" dg:style="font-weight: bold; color: darkslategray">
        <dg:chunk dg:structure="lim" dg:origin="1 240 1228 277 1271">1.</dg:chunk> Financial and Operational Narrative</dg:chunk>
      <docset:CovenantCompliance dg:structure="p" dg:origin="1 240 1327 2310 1367; 1 240 1386 2310 1426; 1 240 1446 2310 1485; 1 240 1505 2310 1545; 1 240 1565 377 1604">Throughout the third quarter of 2146, the Fensal Flats Atmospheric Siphoning facility operated in complete compliance with all covenants and technical metrics detailed in the Secured Credit Agreement (Document 5A). The array's molecular fractionation plants maintained high performance, posting a quarterly average Xenon Siphoning Efficiency Index (XSEI) of <docset:CurrentPeriodValue xsi:type="decimal" dg:value="95.8" dg:origin="1 756 1505 879 1545">95.8%</docset:CurrentPeriodValue>, which comfortably exceeds the <docset:PriorPeriodValue xsi:type="decimal" dg:value="92.0" dg:origin="1 1482 1505 1594 1545">92.0%</docset:PriorPeriodValue> baseline standard specified in Section 4.01(1).</docset:CovenantCompliance>
      <docset:OperationalThroughputNarrative dg:structure="p" dg:origin="1 240 1674 2310 1713; 1 240 1733 2310 1773; 1 240 1793 2310 1832; 1 240 1852 2310 1892; 1 240 1911 863 1951">Noble gas extraction volumes averaged <docset:AnnualCommodityYield dg:origin="1 967 1674 1250 1713">4,680 kilograms</docset:AnnualCommodityYield> of high-purity liquid Xenon per Titan sidereal day, meeting the mandatory Xenon Yield Target of <docset:AnnualCommodityYield dg:origin="1 954 1733 1240 1773">4,500 kilograms</docset:AnnualCommodityYield> outlined in Section 4.01(2). As a result, the Facility Loans accrued interest at the baseline floating rate of <docset:DiscountRate dg:origin="1 1100 1793 1459 1832" dg:style="font-weight: bold">TIDOR plus 6.25%</docset:DiscountRate>, with no triggers of the Xenon Venting Penalty. Additionally, the escrow balances in the Atmospheric Ballast Escrow were fully maintained at the mandated <docset:RestrictedEscrowReserve dg:origin="1 2255 1852 2310 1892; 1 240 1911 460 1951">SC 350,000,000</docset:RestrictedEscrowReserve> under Section 4.01(3).</docset:OperationalThroughputNarrative>
    </docset:OperationalNarrative>
